WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Zero kara kakedashite

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Start running from the beginning,

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
Omoi dake wo dakishimete

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
with nothing but your emotions in your hands.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Sonomama kakenukete

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Just keep running...

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
Itsumo koko de mitsumeteru

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
I'm always watching you from here.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
Hajimete deatta hi no manazashi wasurenai

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
I still remember your expression the day we first met.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
Taiyou mitai ni kokoro wo terashitekureta

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
It lit up my heart like the sun.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
Asu no yukue sagashite nayandeiru nara

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
If you're anxious about where to go tomorrow,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
Ima kimi no tame ni akari ni naritai yo

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
I want to become a beacon to you.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Zero kara tobidatte

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Start flying from the beginning.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Let go of your current self...

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Ima no kimi wo toki hanachi

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
and fly towards infinity.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
Mugen ni habataite

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
I will always watch over you...

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
Donna toki mo mimaru yo

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
no matter how far you fly.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
Kitto zutto tooku made

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.080
Episode 36 - Winter Constellation

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:47.060
Masumi Hayami.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:49.200
Fancy meeting you here, little one!

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:52.060
What are you doing here?

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:53.910
I'm meeting someone.

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:55.920
What about you? Are you on a date?

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:57.570
It's none of your business!

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.730
Phew!

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:03.440
There's no way this heartless man could be Mr. Purple Roses.

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:05.740
What?

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:07.280
Nothing.

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:10.160
I like your dress.

00:02:11.850 --> 00:02:14.790
This way, madame.

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:18.760
Could this be my fan?!

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:22.010
Is that you, Mrs. Kitashirakawa?

00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:27.260
Oh, you're President Hayami's son!

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:29.580
I'm afraid I've allowed myself to lose touch with your family.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.930
And here we are, just standing around.

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:37.750
Maya, Mrs. Kitashirakawa used to be a megastar in the world of opera.

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:40.640
Now, she teaches a number of choirs.

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:46.080
And this is Miss Kitajima. She's soon to play the role of Aldis on stage.

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:48.970
Aldis? You don't say! That takes me back!

00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:51.200
That used to be your role, didn't it?

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.760
She used to play Aldis?

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:57.610
But, don't you have somewhere you have to be tonight?

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:00.680
Yes, about that... someone invited me here.

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:04.230
You know, I was waiting here to meet Mr. Purple Roses!

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:06.490
Pardon me, but to whom are you referring?

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:12.030
I bet he wanted to introduce you two to each other!

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:14.570
What a fiendish plan, I must admit.

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:18.720
Shall we toast to your Aldises?

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:23.230
Miss, I have a message for you.

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:26.200
To: Miss Maya Kitajima.

00:03:24.190 --> 00:03:25.960
A purple rose!

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:34.030
"I'm sure you will learn much from this woman."

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:36.540
"From Your Fan."

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:36.550
"Please enjoy your evening."

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:40.890
Mr. Purple Roses isn't coming after all.

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:43.900
Your Princess Aldis has become legendary:

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:45.940
It was the epitome of refinement.

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.830
But that was over twenty years ago.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:49.940
It's a nice memory to have, though.

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:53.150
Are you all right? You don't look all that happy.

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:55.240
I have no self-belief.

00:03:56.080 --> 00:04:00.230
Grace and class are two things I know nothing about.

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:05.640
I was thirty-one years old when I first started playing Aldis.

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:10.960
I was neither as young nor as pretty as you are now,

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:15.300
but I stepped up onto that stage, believing I was Aldis.

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:18.060
Believing you were Aldis...

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:20.890
What do you think of these roses?

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:24.460
I think they're very pretty.

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:30.020
Then, take this one and say: Oh, what a beautiful rose!

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.340
Oh, what a beautiful rose!

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:36.790
Now, take this one and say the exact same thing?

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:46.070
Oh, what a beautiful rose!

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:47.470
You lied.

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:52.720
Nobody will really believe that a wilted rose can be beautiful.

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:56.270
So, try saying it now with this one?

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:59.010
Say it as though you're on stage!

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:03.020
As though I'm on stage...

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:14.990
Oh, what a beautiful rose!

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:17.440
You did that very well.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:20.520
This is what acting is all about.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:21.790
Just then,

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:26.750
you revisited the feeling of looking at a beautiful rose in your heart and then said the line.

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:29.400
You recreated the feeling.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.610
Recreated the feeling?

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:34.860
If the real emotion isn't inside you somewhere,

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:38.150
you'll never convince an audience.

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:45.130
If you have the heart of a princess, then all your movements will appear regal.

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:49.480
"My kingdom: Lastonia."

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:53.170
"The Winter Emperor rules this land for six months every year."

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:58.920
"My ears have been infected by the howls of snowstorms and I can't rid myself of them."

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:00.880
"But I know that...

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:05.840
the smile of the Spring Goddess is stronger than the Winter Emperor's sword."

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:13.100
"Blizzards: my army! Arise! Our enemy is in that castle! Go destroy them!"

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.070
"Ice..."

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:19.520
Neither of you understand your roles yet.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:21.610
I can't bare to look at this poor excuse for acting.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:26.120
Mr. Fuuma, you'll have to excuse me.

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:28.920
With actors like these, this simply doesn't pass for a rehearsal.

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:29.530
Ms. Tsukikage!

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:31.370
Ms. Tsukikage!

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:34.100
Can I have a quick word please?

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:36.300
Which part didn't you like?

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:40.980
Mr. Fuuma, I'm taking these two aside for a while.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.950
Nittei Storage

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:47.540
At the present moment, I am Haldora, mother to Lastonia's King.

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:50.040
I am blind and unable to walk.

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:56.800
I want to have a conversation with you, but you will be Aldis and Orgeld.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:03.360
"You have come to see me. Have you kept well?"

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.230
"Yes, Grandmother."

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:09.350
"Thank you for asking! I'm fine and dandy!"

00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:13.340
And how do you feel about the Empress Dowager?

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:16.030
Be honest.

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:18.500
What would I feel towards the Empress Dowager, a woman I've never met?

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:22.330
The person who sat back while my mother was sentenced to death by beheading?

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:23.860
I hate her.

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:26.430
But I could never tell her that in this situation.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:28.990
I'm always hearing how much Grandmother dislikes other people.

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:31.890
Even so, Aldis is so kind that she would still like her.

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:34.530
"I love you, Grandmother!"

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:37.920
"I do think you're a little scary sometimes, though."

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:40.100
"I deeply respect you."

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:44.950
"And why do you respect me when you've never even met me till now?"

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:49.470
"Because of what I've been told by people who visit me in the dungeon."

00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:50.510
"Such as?"

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:56.630
"That you are a great person who cares more for this country than anyone."

00:07:57.480 --> 00:08:00.050
"Thank you, Orgeld."

00:08:00.050 --> 00:08:02.630
"Out of interest, what types of animals do you two like?"

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:04.260
"Animals?"

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:06.410
"I like all animals!"

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:08.190
"I love everything!"

00:08:08.970 --> 00:08:11.050
Yes, you'd say something like that.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:14.200
But Orgeld has spent her whole life locked up.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:16.560
What kind of animals would she have seen from her cell window?

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:20.250
"Birds."

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:25.440
"I like birds, because they are free to soar and swoop around the outside world."

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:29.840
I'm slowly beginning to understand how Orgeld feels.

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:33.920
How do you feel about each other?

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:36.780
"She's very pretty."

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:38.710
"Are you jealous of her?"

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:41.510
"No."

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:46.490
"She's the only person who even remotely cared about me while I was in jail."

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:48.390
"And what do you have to say to that, Aldis?"

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:52.360
"I'm very happy to hear that she feels that way about me."

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:54.890
"Would you let me call you my sister?"

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:59.080
"Of course, Aldis. I'm happy to have a younger sister like you."

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:01.190
"Aldis, Orgeld..."

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:04.420
"What do you both think about Lastonia?"

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:08.940
"This country, ruled by your father. Your country!"

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:11.410
"What do you think of it, Aldis?"

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:14.810
I could never reveal my ambitions to overthrow the King to her.

00:09:14.810 --> 00:09:16.140
What should I say?

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:18.400
"Well? What's wrong?"

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:20.070
"Answer me!"

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:29.500
So, now you understand why I called your acting half-baked!

00:09:30.230 --> 00:09:35.520
You've grasped nothing of your characters. That's why they're so unconvincing.

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:40.650
You understand nothing of Aldis's mentality, of Orgeld's interests nor her motivations!

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:47.640
Okay, get in.

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:52.150
Your acting is missing something.

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:53.750
It lacks temperature.

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:54.750
What?

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:57.150
If you want to get a hold on your characters, you'll have to go in there.

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:06.150
Lastonia is a country to the north.

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:13.250
I don't get any sense of its severe winters, locked in ice and snow,

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:16.290
nor the thawing warmth of spring from your acting.

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:18.290
Ms. Tsukikage?

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:18.290
You're cold, aren't you?

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:20.420
This is the chill of Lastonia!

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:22.150
Let it permeate your skin!

00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:27.990
I'm so cold!

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:29.860
It's as though ice has penetrated my very core!

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:31.730
I feel like my blood is about to freeze.

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:35.140
It feels more like pain than simply being cold.

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:38.850
Hey, do you want to dance?

00:10:39.590 --> 00:10:43.090
If we move around, we'll warm up!

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:46.240
Ayumi!

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:51.800
It's no good. My body's so stiff, I can't move.

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:54.830
The cold has pierced my chest!

00:10:54.830 --> 00:10:55.680
It hurts!

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:56.700
Ayumi!

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:57.860
Hang in there!

00:10:57.860 --> 00:11:00.980
All right. Now, I want you to recite your lines, Orgeld.

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:04.430
Start with "My kingdom: Lastonia."

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:10.060
What's wrong?

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.560
This is what Lastonia's winters are like.

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:14.670
This is the same temperature.

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:16.530
The same as Lastonia's winters...

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:18.500
The same as Lastonia's winters...

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:21.270
Ayumi?

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:24.040
"My kingdom: Lastonia."

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:28.430
"The Winter Emperor rules this land for six months every year."

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:33.940
"The arrows of ice and my armor of snow have frozen my heart."

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:37.410
"I am Princess Orgeld!"

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:43.480
"Mankind's cold heart has turned me into the Winter Emperor's daughter!"

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:47.250
"Blizzards: my army!"

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:49.830
"Our enemy is in that castle! To arms!"

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:55.470
"This castle will fall by my hand and I will show no mercy until it falls!"

00:11:56.390 --> 00:12:01.830
"Until that day comes, I will hold no hesitation in my heart; the ice will not melt!"

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:02.890
"I will..."

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:03.970
Ayumi!

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:12.250
All right, you two. You can come out now.

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:17.230
It's so warm out here.

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:19.960
Maya, recite Aldis's lines.

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:27.900
It feels like the blood in my body has started to melt and flow again.

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:32.020
"My kingdom: Lastonia."

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:36.290
"The Winter Emperor rules this land for six months every year."

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:45.440
"But I know that the smile of the Spring Goddess is stronger than the Winter Emperor's sword."

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:51.440
"I am your daughter, O Spring Goddess. Even when our kingdom is ruled by the Winter Emperor,

00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:58.690
I shall carry your sunlight in my eyes and let the flowers of spring flourish in my heart."

00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:05.070
"I would like to be the daughter of the Spring Goddess for every man and woman of this kingdom."

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:08.050
You must never forget how you're feeling right now.

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:09.060
Ma'am!

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:14.510
That's right. Words that are anchored in real emotion carry conviction.

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:20.990
Orgeld's heart is frozen; it is as cold as the inside of that freezer.

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:26.070
Aldis's heart feels like the rush of warmth you felt when you came out.

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:30.010
Hers is a heart wrapped in tranquility and happiness.

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:33.350
I will be testing you again next week.

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:35.830
How's your home life?

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:37.010
Is there anything you need?

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:39.580
I'm getting by.

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:41.700
Glad to hear it. See you later.

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:43.300
Ayumi!

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:43.960
What?

00:13:44.310 --> 00:13:47.740
You're a really nice person.

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:51.290
That's the first time anyone's ever said that to me.

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:13.380
Please stop the fight!

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:21.170
So, tell me, Maya. Do you think I'm beautiful?

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:22.530
Well...

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:23.970
Please, be honest.

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:27.750
I think you're refined and a wonderful person, but I don't think I could go as far...

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:30.490
as to call you beautiful.

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:37.030
You're absolutely right. That's why I always enjoyed getting ready to go on stage.

00:14:37.030 --> 00:14:40.490
My makeup was like a rose... When I wore a flowing dress, I experienced...

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:43.310
the joy of metamorphosis.

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:47.730
You know, Maya, in the Kabuki Theater, all the female roles are played by men.

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:52.470
And yet, when they stand up on that stage, they are more feminine than real women!

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:55.720
The true face of an actor is irrelevant.

00:14:55.720 --> 00:15:01.440
What is important is capturing and depicting your character wholeheartedly.

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:05.140
And you, Maya, you have the power of acting. Don't you agree?

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:06.550
Yes!

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:15.520
Do you know the name of this song?

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:16.790
No.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:18.580
That's fine.

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:23.790
A pure heart that finds it beautiful is much more important than any knowledge pertaining to it.

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:28.290
I guess Aldis's peaceful heart is composed of such feelings.

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:33.300
Not knowledge, but a pure heart that finds everything beautiful...

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:44.480
I want to do something for my poor sister who has been locked away all this time.

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:47.970
I want to make her happy.

00:15:51.270 --> 00:15:52.480
Don't show your face around here again!

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:55.760
All you do is freak out our customers!

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:14.990
You've been hanging out here a lot lately.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:16.740
What do you want?

00:16:17.070 --> 00:16:18.570
We don't like your face!

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:20.970
You haven't even bothered to say hello.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.060
Don't think I don't know what you're doing.

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:26.210
You're just a rich kid who thinks it's cool to slum it!

00:16:26.850 --> 00:16:29.220
Nice watch you got there!

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:31.810
If you want it, you can get down on your knees and grovel for it.

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:33.420
Bitch!

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:35.820
Whore!

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:52.820
We won't forget this!

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:56.270
As they say: "Love thine enemies," huh?

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:59.890
You're wrong, Aldis.

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:03.500
Hatred. That's what gives people strength!

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:06.910
Nittei Theater

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:09.190
Time for your test.

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:13.060
I want Aldis to take this jewel from the Empress Dowager first,

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:16.140
and then, I want Orgeld to take it from Aldis.

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:20.020
"Why do you want this jewel, Aldis?"

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:23.030
"Because it's beautiful."

00:17:23.460 --> 00:17:24.990
And you, Orgeld?

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:26.510
"Because I covet it."

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:28.810
Very well.

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:31.810
Now, go.

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:35.330
The blind Empress Dowager is sitting right here.

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:38.860
I'm in the court of my Grandmother which lies to the north.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:47.110
"Who's there?"

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:49.570
"Grandmother, it's me, Aldis!"

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:50.590
"Aldis?"

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:52.750
"Did I surprise you?"

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:57.230
"Oh, what a beautiful gemstone!"

00:17:57.230 --> 00:18:02.230
"This is a very important heirloom."

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:08.570
"It was placed on your grandfather's neck, the previous king, when he was born."

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:12.080
"When his mother passed it on to me just before our marriage,

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:16.390
it felt as though she was entrusting me with the King's life itself."

00:18:16.390 --> 00:18:19.400
"I had no idea it was so precious to you!"

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:23.470
"So it is, Aldis. What's wrong?"

00:18:23.470 --> 00:18:30.030
I can't take it now, not after hearing that story.

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:34.350
I know Aldis couldn't, Maya.

00:18:34.350 --> 00:18:35.860
Ms. Tsukikage.

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:40.770
Then, verbalize Aldis's true feelings.

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:46.960
"It's such a beautiful gem that I almost begged you to give it to me."

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:49.770
"I'm sorry, Grandmother!"

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:54.270
"You are a good child. You're the only one I can trust in this entire kingdom."

00:18:54.990 --> 00:18:57.030
"Here you go."

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:58.470
"But, Grandmother..."

00:18:58.470 --> 00:19:01.690
"It's fine. Take it."

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:11.880
"Oh, what a beautiful gemstone!"

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:14.630
"Yes. Grandmother just gave it to me!"

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:17.080
"She told me that she really treasures it."

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:20.870
"You're so lucky. Everyone loves you."

00:19:21.450 --> 00:19:23.430
"Not like me."

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:24.600
"You mustn't say that!"

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:27.150
"I love you!"

00:19:27.150 --> 00:19:28.240
"Really?"

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:32.380
"Then, prove it. Give me that jewel."

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:34.910
"But..."

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:37.500
"Never mind, Aldis."

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:39.960
"I knew I could never expect you to give me something so precious."

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:45.350
"No, it's not that. I promised Grandmother I'd cherish it."

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:47.630
"I'm sorry for putting you in that position."

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:54.110
"It's not like I really want the jewel; I'm just jealous of how loved you are."

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:04.670
"I'm sure Grandmother will understand if I tell her I gave it to you. You are my older sister, after all."

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:08.440
"Thank you, Aldis! I'll keep it safe!"

00:20:14.550 --> 00:20:20.820
"Aldis. Can you keep it a secret that you gave me this?"

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:24.620
"I want everyone to think that Grandmother gave it to me herself."

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:27.250
"I want everyone to think that she loves me."

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:29.190
"All right."

00:20:29.190 --> 00:20:31.530
Aldis. What are you feeling right now?

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:35.540
I'm happy that I could bring so much happiness to my older sister.

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:39.390
After all, she has lived through so much sadness up to this point.

00:20:39.390 --> 00:20:40.580
And you, Orgeld?

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:42.560
I'm thinking Aldis is stupid.

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:48.460
I can use the Empress Dowager's jewel to further my own ambitions.

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:55.400
Stop right there and return to rehearsals.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:58.920
Starting tomorrow, we will rehearse on the stage.

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:04.140
A center seat in the seventh row.

00:21:04.460 --> 00:21:06.000
It's a good seat.

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:11.540
Give it your all and you'll win our bet, Maya.

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:24.880
I have to admit, I'm a little worried about all the rumors I've been hearing about miscasting.

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:28.370
If Maya can't pull off a comeback with this play,

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:29.830
she'll never get another chance.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:31.760
It's her moment of truth.

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:36.630
The curtain's going up on the play that Maya's revival is riding on.

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:42.630
Now she's facing her rival, Ayumi, will Maya finally be able to take the first step...

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:48.200
that will eventually lead her back into the acting world?

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:18.080
Chikazukitai noni toozaketeshimau

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:18.080
I want to be close to you, but you're distancing yourself.

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:31.320
Dakishimetai toki wazato hanareteshimau

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:31.320
When I want to hold you, you deliberately run away.

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:44.070
Marude jishaku no N to N no you da ne

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:44.070
We're like two poles on a magnet...

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:55.190
Otagai amari nimo nisugita seikana?

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:55.190
Maybe we're too alike?

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:09.920
Motto motto sunao na hitomi de mitsureba

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:09.920
If you allow your eyes to see the truth,

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:21.510
Yodonderu izumi mo suki tooru hazusa

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:21.510
even quagmires will become crystal clear.

00:23:24.030 --> 00:23:26.330
Maya, I can't believe it.

00:23:26.840 --> 00:23:29.320
Is this another of your masks?!

00:23:29.680 --> 00:23:34.090
Every time your Aldis smiles, I can feel the melting warmth of spring!

00:23:34.660 --> 00:23:36.680
I can hardly believe your talent.

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:43.310
But the shadow of Ayumi's Orgeld is dark and expanding quickly.

00:23:43.870 --> 00:23:47.510
The stage will crumble if the darkness swallows the light!

00:23:45.620 --> 00:23:51.500
Episode 37 - The Two Princesses: Act One
